OL,3,GNEWSAWork to city park will help
OL,4,Awildflowers thrive
OL,5,
OL,6,FA green space in Nottingham city centre
OL,7,Fis due to have its annual
OL,8,F"cut-and-lift" to prepare for next
OL,9,Fyear's wildflowers.
OL,11,FThe Green Heart, which opened in
OL,12,FOctober 2024, is an area of flowers,
OL,13,Fponds, trees and seating on part of the
OL,14,Fsite of the old Broadmarsh shopping
OL,15,Fcentre.
OL,17,FThe work on Thursday will focus on
OL,18,Fremoving the season's growth to help
OL,19,Fmaintain the award-winning green space.
OL,21,FCouncil bosses say it is an essential
OL,22,Fpart of meadow management.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
